capture_mode.description:
Explicit capture stage mode. Recurring links require `one_stage`.
For mixed card + SBP links, `two_stage` applies only to card payments;
SBP payments created from the same link are one-stage.

event-payment-pending-3ds.description:
Emitted when a card payment is waiting for cardholder 3DS authentication.
Your frontend should continue the 3DS flow using the execute response;
this webhook is an asynchronous status signal for your backend.

parameters.description:
Merchant organization/shop scope. Secret API keys are organization-scoped;
omitting this parameter uses the organization bound to the API key.
Supplying a different organization returns 403.

payment.pending_3ds.description:
